An omitted lot cost on a full sale removes the entire remaining SEK basis across different lots.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
account Income:Gains

2024-01-01 First purchase
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -200 SEK

2024-01-02 Second purchase at a different unit cost
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {150 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -450 SEK

2024-01-03 Sale of the entire remaining holding
  Assets:Fund  -5 FUND @ 200 SEK
  Assets:Cash  1000 SEK
  Income:Gains  -350 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 First purchase
    Assets:Fund                         2 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -200.00 SEK

2024-01-02 Second purchase at a different unit cost
    Assets:Fund                         3 FUND {150.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -450.00 SEK

2024-01-03 Sale of the entire remaining holding
    Assets:Fund                         -5 FUND {130.00 SEK} @ 200.00 SEK
    Assets:Cash                         1,000.00 SEK
    Income:Gains                         -350.00 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========
